'''E-567''' is one of the six unfinished [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku Enemies]] whose IDs are between [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] and [[Dark Priest Mamon]]. Due to its placement in the [[Enemy Release Order]], it could potentially be a stand-in for a Wicked [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]]. As of now, however, it looks and acts exactly like [[Doge]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

